{"id":"5c8c56808857d2df","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound.md","title":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","display":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","73-thm-context-free-pumping-lemma"],"display":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.2, print pp. 279–287; PDF pp. 301–309","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§6.1, Lemma 6.1, pp. 125–129; local pumping statement","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</span><span>73-thm-context-free-pumping-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-context-free-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.2, print pp. 279–287; PDF pp. 301–309"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§6.1, Lemma 6.1, pp. 125–129; local pumping statement"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Put a grammar for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> in CNF. A sufficiently tall parse tree repeats a nonterminal on one root-to-leaf path; the two occurrences delimit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>CNF bounds the yield below the repeated upper node, giving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|vxy|\\leq p\">\\(|vxy|\\leq p\\)</span>, while distinct repeated levels ensure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|vy|\\geq1\">\\(|vy|\\geq1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free language, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p\\to\n\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=uvxyz\\land |vxy|\\leq p\\land |vy|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(uv^ixy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"|vxy|\\leq p","display":false},{"tex":"|vy|\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b2a2a92345299bc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$ 为三个互异字符的字母表，$V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)$、$|V|=5$ 且 $V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$；$I=\\{f,g\\}$，$f\\ne g$，$\\varepsilon\\notin I$。指标文法语义见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]；非 CFL 的泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"4a0f36e55ab71a8b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}$ 为三个数值字符的字母表。栈机、各变体和语言见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]；CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"5a0a940e7dd346c9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为单字符字母表。0L 语言见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]，CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound|Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages]]"},{"id":"08a47204ea81e603","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"上下文无关语言的泵引理采用 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]] 的 $\\Sigma=\\Sigma_3$ 实例；$a,b,c$ 的两两不等由 $|\\Sigma_3|=3$ 保证。"},{"id":"edb85b0ac6775cd2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["83639a9615c06195","7505f1b37c6f6f74","0a6da8c909717780"]}